    narr:narration """This hub covers QuintonFairweather's 20260717 statements establishing the adoption of Zypherion as the analytics database. Three source expressions carry the core claims: [adoption decision for Zypherion](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) names the platform and frames the move as current and communal; [columnar-query performance rationale](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) supplies the technical justification in expert register; and [migration timing commitment](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) sets a future-tense, authority-ranked deadline. Three parallel summary expressions restate these in structured form: [database label restatement](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4), [performance figure restatement](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5), and [timeline restatement with Q3 2026 specificity](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6). The hub does not contain cost analysis, vendor comparison, risk assessment, rollback planning, or stakeholder dissent — queries on those topics will not find support here.""" ;
